    "Spent": {
      "description": "What a step cost, said out loud (D20).\n\nPhase 1 asked that tokens reach the observer. They did not: an adapter *reports* usage inside a\n`Completed` observation's output dict, by convention, and anyone wanting to know what a run cost\nhad to know that convention and parse somebody else's payload. Reporting and recording are\ndifferent jobs, and this is the record.\n\nEmitted only when there is something to say \u2014 a step that cost nothing emits none, because a\nkind that appears when there is nothing to report is a kind readers learn to skip.",
      "properties": {
        "at": {
          "title": "At",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "kind": {
          "const": "spent",
          "default": "spent",
          "title": "Kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "run_id": {
          "title": "Run Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "seq": {
          "title": "Seq",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "step": {
          "title": "Step",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "usage": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Usage"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "run_id",
        "seq",
        "at",
        "step",
        "usage"
      ],
      "title": "Spent",
      "type": "object"
    },
